data: {"id": "91329aede4914d41-thinking-parallel_evidence-123", "run_id": "91329aede4914d41", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "TodoWrite", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=470 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 5 completed, 0 in progress, 0 pending\n[✓] [1] 确认 Pod 身份与当前状态（Pending / Cre", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788774417137, "lane_stage": "evidence", "evidence_context": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-stream.v1", "group_id": "g1", "dimension": "other"}, "tool_call_id": "call_00f80e708e8648fe94c3550a", "tool_sequence": 6, "semantic_success": true, "result": "TodoWrite 输出摘要: raw_chars=470 lines=9\nInvestigation plan updated with 5 tasks.\n# CURRENT INVESTIGATION TASKS\n**Task Status**: 5 completed, 0 in progress, 0 pending\n[✓] [1] 确认 Pod 身份与当前状态（Pending / CreateContainerConfigError）\n[✓] [2] 通过 kubectl events 和 describe 获取直接错误信息\n[✓] [3] 通过 kubectl_get_yaml 获取 Pod spec 中的 Secret key 引用\n[✓] [4] 通过 run_bash_command 获取 Secret workload-input 的真实 data 键\n[✓] [5] 通过 query_pod_topology 确认控制器与节点关系\n**Instructions**: Use TodoWrite tool to update task status as you work.", "raw_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/91329aede4914d41-g1/tools/009-evidence-TodoWrite.raw.txt", "structured_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/91329aede4914d41-g1/tools/009-evidence-TodoWrite.structured.json", "summary_ref": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/91329aede4914d41-g1/tools/009-evidence-TodoWrite.summary.txt"}

