data: {"id": "91329aede4914d41-thinking-parallel_evidence-375", "run_id": "91329aede4914d41", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "All tasks are completed. The root cause is clearly identified:\n\n- **Pod Status**: `Pending` with `CreateContainerConfigError` (confirmed by describe, events, yaml, and Prometheus metrics).\n- **Root Cause**: The Pod spec references a Secret key `unavailable-key` in `Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`, but the Secret only contains the key `available-key`. This key mismatch causes the kubelet to fail creating the container.\n- **Evidence Summary**:\n  - `kubectl get secret workload-input -o yaml` s", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788774421333, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

